# Backend API

The backend API provides FastAPI endpoints for the chatbot interface.

## Key Files

- [backend/api/__init__.py](mdc:backend/api/__init__.py): API initialization
- [backend/api/introspect.py](mdc:backend/api/introspect.py): Endpoints for introspection data management
- [backend/api/crew.py](mdc:backend/api/crew.py): Endpoints for CrewAI mental health analysis
- [backend/api/llm_providers.py](mdc:backend/api/llm_providers.py): LLM provider configurations

## Endpoints

The backend provides several endpoints:

- `/api/introspect/data`: Get/update raw introspection data
- `/api/introspect/insights`: Get/update processed introspection insights
- `/api/crew/analyze`: Start mental health analysis
- `/api/crew/status/{task_id}`: Check analysis status
- `/api/crew/result/{task_id}`: Get analysis results

